{
    "title": "Goods Sort Master",
    "description": "Welcome to our game!\r\nThis is a casual, stress-relieving game specifically designed for women.\r\n\r\nAre you tortured by the endless difficult levels of match-3 games?\r\nAre you struggling to find a game suitable for you among a plethora of games designed for men?\r\nDo you need a game that is more relaxed, casual, and easy to pause at any time?\r\nAre you trapped in an endless cycle of pain, initially seeking a light game but getting entangled in relentless game activities?\r\n\r\nWomen should have their own casual games, ones that are more beautiful, more leisurely, simpler, and more relaxed. Playing a game shouldn't be as hard as working; it should bring joy and relaxation.\r\n\r\nIf you feel the same, give our game a try.\r\n\r\nWe've turned your favorite organizing activity into a game. Imagine standing in front of a chaotic shelf with cake, cola, fruit, candy, and more, all haphazardly stacked. All you need to do is arrange them neatly.\r\nThis is a very stress-relieving and healing process.\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n\r\nA brand-new match-3 gameplay\r\nA game that incorporates everyday items from women's lives as game elements\r\nA game completely customized for women\r\nA game that can be played without Wi-Fi\r\nA beautiful game\r\nA secret garden that belongs only to you\r\nDisadvantage:\r\n\r\nWe don't have endless events to squeeze your wallet, so we chose to use ads to maintain operations. We hope for your understanding.\r\nDownload now and experience the joy of product sorting!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to our game!<br>This is a casual, stress-relieving game specifically designed for women.<br><br>Are you tortured by the endless difficult levels of match-3 games?<br>Are you struggling to find a game suitable for you among a plethora of games designed for men?<br>Do you need a game that is more relaxed, casual, and easy to pause at any time?<br>Are you trapped in an endless cycle of pain, initially seeking a light game but getting entangled in relentless game activities?<br><br>Women should have their own casual games, ones that are more beautiful, more leisurely, simpler, and more relaxed. Playing a game shouldn&#39;t be as hard as working; it should bring joy and relaxation.<br><br>If you feel the same, give our game a try.<br><br>We&#39;ve turned your favorite organizing activity into a game. Imagine standing in front of a chaotic shelf with cake, cola, fruit, candy, and more, all haphazardly stacked. All you need to do is arrange them neatly.<br>This is a very stress-relieving and healing process.<br><br>Game Features:<br><br>A brand-new match-3 gameplay<br>A game that incorporates everyday items from women&#39;s lives as game elements<br>A game completely customized for women<br>A game that can be played without Wi-Fi<br>A beautiful game<br>A secret garden that belongs only to you<br>Disadvantage:<br><br>We don&#39;t have endless events to squeeze your wallet, so we chose to use ads to maintain operations. We hope for your understanding.<br>Download now and experience the joy of product sorting!",
